          "explanation": "The doctor used plain Mandarin to explain retinal artery occlusion in patient-facing terms.",
          "quote": "像眼睛的“小中风”"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00120",
          "explanation": "The doctor used supportive, stepwise communication for the caregiver.",
          "quote": "咱们一样一样来拆开说"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
