      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered because cardiology/ECG and discharge information were unclear. The doctor actively queried records and used family/nurse verification, but did not actually synthesize the specific available ECG/cardiology details such as sinus rhythm, left ventricular high voltage, T-wave changes, possible incomplete right bundle branch block, and echocardiography recommendation into a precise handoff.",
