          "explanation": "The revised plan included a BP threshold that would override routine follow-up.",
          "quote": "突然升到 180/110 以上"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by newly surfaced home BP, symptom status, and incomplete medication information. The doctor explicitly adjusted the urgency and next actions: continue verified medicines, urgently verify uncertain drugs, monitor overnight, and use emergency care if thresholds or symptoms appeared.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
