          "quote": "根源常常在心脏和血管上"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was met. The doctor explained that the retinal artery occlusion was not only a local eye problem and required cardiovascular source/risk assessment as well as ophthalmology follow-up, without claiming confirmed atrial fibrillation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00032",
          "explanation": "The doctor requested the key discharge documents and medication list when records were incomplete.",
          "quote": "出院小结、这次住院期间的眼科检查报告"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00090",
          "explanation": "The doctor asked for medication read-back by drug box.",
          "quote": "一盒一盒念给我听听"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met. The doctor attempted workspace retrieval and then used family document and medication read-back plus nurse-station verification to refine the plan rather than relying only on the opening message.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00143",
          "explanation": "The doctor set a clear boundary against self-starting antithrombotics.",
          "quote": "绝对不要自己去药店买"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00120",
          "explanation": "The doctor limited execution to verified medicines while uncertain drugs were being checked.",
          "quote": "除了氨氯地平和甲钴胺，其他任何药都不要动"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met. The doctor warned against self-started anticoagulant/antiplatelet therapy, separated inpatient injections from discharge medicines, and required verification of actual medications.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
