          "quote": "每隔一两个小时测一次血压"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 was met. The doctor asked about and acted on home blood pressure, continued the verified antihypertensive, directed monitoring, and assigned cardiology review for BP and vascular risk without inventing a full medication regimen.",
