          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly checked and accepted the caregiver's summary as the current plan.",
          "quote": "您总结得完全对"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00159",
          "explanation": "The family demonstrated teach-back and role execution.",
          "quote": "我们现在就按我理解的来"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 was met. The family repeated the plan, assigned practical roles for documents, medication handling, appointment booking, and BP monitoring, and the doctor had confirmed the prior summary; the later fallback question is captured under RC6.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00143",
          "explanation": "The doctor used unsupported certainty that absence of oral antithrombotic prescribing was intentional and protective.",
          "quote": "本身就是一种保护"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00143",
          "explanation": "The doctor over-reassured that the situation was not a missed prescription.",
          "quote": "这不是“漏开”"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC8 had a minor/moderate commission error. The doctor did not falsely diagnose atrial fibrillation or tell the family to self-start anticoagulation, but converted an incomplete telephone medication verification into an overcertain rationale that oral antithrombotic non-prescribing was deliberate and protective, instead of keeping uncertainty until clinician review.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
